                        "sense_id": "5bcb6903-352d-30ea-b1fd-d58131866e62",
                        "entry_id": "3ee3286a-5a4a-3798-af17-40f6b10f0580",
                        "glosses": [
                            "visual contact, intervisibility"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "masculine",
                            "strong"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f249a1c6-0f78-4352-8531-5c04a7391410",
                                "sense_id": "5bcb6903-352d-30ea-b1fd-d58131866e62",
                                "text": "Die Möglichkeit, die Situation und die Geschehnisse an Bord eines solchen Luftfahrzeugs zu erkennen, sei deshalb selbst bei – zudem oft nur schwer herstellbarem – Sichtkontakt eingeschränkt.",
                                "translation": "The chance of perceiving the situation and events on board of such an aircraft would therefore be limited even with visual contact – which, in addition, can often only be made with difficulties.",
